          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘોરવું — ghorvũ — \"to snore\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દાદા આખી રાત ઘોરે છે. dādā ākhī rāt ghore che. Grandfather snores all night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): તે આખી રાત ઘોર્યો, te ākhī rāt ghoryo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘોરવું (ghorvũ) goes back to Sanskrit ghurati, \"cries out frighteningly\", probably an imitative word; CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"to snore\" (CDIAL 4487)."
            }
          ]
        },
